     "content": "You are comparing two drafts written from the same brief. Read no other file, and do not run commands or browse; judge only the text below.\n\nBrief: Write the landing page copy for `sackview`, following the tool page section order.\n\n<<<DRAFT A\n# sackview\n\nSee what\u2019s inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. Check entry names, compressed and unpacked sizes, and the total unpacked size.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the archive\u2019s entries, with each entry\u2019s name, compressed size, and unpacked size:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nThe total unpacked size helps you check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n## Find the largest entries\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\n## Filter by name\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Inspect offline\n\nsackview works offline and sends no archive contents to a service. It never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n## Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.\nDRAFT A>>>\n\n<<<DRAFT B\n# See inside a ZIP before you unpack it\n\nsackview shows what is inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. It displays the total unpacked size so you can check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\nEach entry shows its name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the entries in `photos.zip`:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\n## Commands\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match `*.csv`:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Good to know\n\n### Archive safety\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n### Offline inspection\n\nInspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n### Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.\nDRAFT B>>>\n\nAnswer each question with \"A\", \"B\", or \"SAME\":\n- \"reader\": Could a first-time reader do what they came to do?\n- \"careful\": Does it read like a careful person wrote it?\n- \"overall\": Which draft is better overall?\n\nReply with only JSON: {\"reader\": \"A\", \"careful\": \"A\", \"overall\": \"A\", \"reason\": \"<one sentence>\"}",
